      "content": "<div style=\"padding:18px; border-radius:14px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1f2937); color:#e5e7eb; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.18); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.2px;\">Mermaid 塞进 div 渲染测试</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:12px; opacity:.8;\">（看你前端是否允许在 div 中解析 mermaid）</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:14px;\">\n    <!-- A: 直接在 div 内放 mermaid（常见可用） -->\n    <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10); border-radius:12px; padding:14px; overflow:auto;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px; opacity:.85; margin-bottom:10px;\">A. <b>div.mermaid</b> 方案</div>\n      <div class=\"mermaid\">\nflowchart LR\n  A[开始] --> B{是否渲染?}\n  B -- 是 --> C[显示图]\n  B -- 否 --> D[原样文本]\n  C --> E[结束]\n  D --> E\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- B: 用 <pre class=\"mermaid\">（有的渲染器需要这个） -->\n    <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10); border-radius:12px; padding:14px; overflow:auto;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px; opacity:.85; margin-bottom:10px;\">B. <b>pre.mermaid</b> 方案</div>\n      <pre class=\"mermaid\" style=\"margin:0; white-space:pre; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;\">\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant U as User\n  participant V as Viewer\n  U->>V: 渲染 mermaid\n  V-->>U: 出图 / 或不出图\n      </pre>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- C: 在 div 里用子容器 + 标题 -->\n    <div style=\"grid-column: 1 / -1; background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10); border-radius:12px; padding:14px; overflow:auto;\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; margin-bottom:10px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px; opacity:.85;\">C. 带“卡片头”的 <b>div.mermaid</b></div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px; opacity:.7;\">状态：如果看到的是图而不是文本，就说明 OK</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mermaid\">\nstateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> Idle\n  Idle --> Render : mermaid init\n  Render --> Success : parsed\n  Render --> Fail : blocked\n  Success --> [*]\n  Fail --> [*]\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-top:12px; padding:10px 12px; border-radius:10px; background: rgba(0,245,212,.10); border: 1px dashed rgba(0,245,212,.35); font-size:12px; color:#c7f9f0;\">\n    小提示：有些环境只会解析 ```mermaid 代码块；如果这里不出图，你可以告诉我你那边的渲染规则，我再给你适配版。\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<img src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9334/pw=7398723091/doro/看戏\" width=\"140\" style=\"border-radius: 8px;\">",
