      "content": "<div style=\"padding:18px; border-radius:16px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#0b1220,#111827); color:#e5e7eb; box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.25); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.2px; font-size:16px;\">把 <code>```mermaid</code> 代码块塞进 <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> 的渲染测试</div>\n    <div style=\"opacity:.75; font-size:12px;\">粽子出动～</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap:14px;\">\n    <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10); border-radius:14px; padding:14px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px; opacity:.85; margin-bottom:10px;\">方案 A：普通 div（很多渲染器会把 div 内 markdown 当“纯文本”）</div>\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  A[开始] --> B{div里会解析吗?}\n  B -- 会 --> C[显示图]\n  B -- 不会 --> D[显示为代码块文本]\n  C --> E[结束]\n  D --> E\n```\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10); border-radius:14px; padding:14px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px; opacity:.85; margin-bottom:10px;\">方案 B：给 div 加 <code>markdown=\"1\"</code>（部分引擎支持在 HTML 内继续解析 markdown）</div>\n\n<div markdown=\"1\">\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant U as User\n  participant R as Renderer\n  U->>R: 这是 mermaid 代码块\n  R-->>U: 若支持 HTML 内 markdown -> 出图\n  R-->>U: 若不支持 -> 仍是代码块\n```\n\n</div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10); border-radius:14px; padding:14px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px; opacity:.85; margin-bottom:10px;\">方案 C：再来一个图（看哪种能被你环境识别）</div>\n\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> Idle\n  Idle --> TryParse: render\n  TryParse --> OK: supported\n  TryParse --> NO: blocked\n  OK --> [*]\n  NO --> [*]\n```\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-top:12px; padding:10px 12px; border-radius:12px; background: rgba(0,245,212,.10); border: 1px dashed rgba(0,245,212,.35); font-size:12px; color:#c7f9f0;\">\n    你看结果：如果在卡片里“直接出图”，说明支持 HTML 容器内的 mermaid 代码块解析；如果只显示代码文本，告诉我你用的渲染器/平台，我再给你改成它吃的格式～\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<img src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9334/pw=7398723091/doro/看着你\" width=\"140\" style=\"border-radius: 8px;\">",
