      "content": "<div style=\"padding:18px; border-radius:16px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#0b1220,#111827); color:#e5e7eb; box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.25); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.2px; font-size:16px;\">把 <code>```latex</code> 代码块塞进 <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> 的渲染测试</div>\n    <div style=\"opacity:.78; font-size:12px;\">（看你环境会不会在 div 里继续解析）</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap:14px;\">\n    <!-- A: div里直接放 latex fenced code block -->\n    <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10); border-radius:14px; padding:14px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px; opacity:.85; margin-bottom:10px;\">方案 A：普通 div + <b>```latex</b>（很多渲染器会把它当纯文本）</div>\n\n```latex\n\\[\n\\int_{0}^{1} x^2\\,dx = \\frac{1}{3}\n\\]\n```\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- B: markdown=\"1\" -->\n    <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10); border-radius:14px; padding:14px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px; opacity:.85; margin-bottom:10px;\">方案 B：<code>markdown=\"1\"</code>（如果你的引擎支持“HTML 内继续解析 Markdown”就可能生效）</div>\n\n      <div markdown=\"1\">\n\n```latex\n\\[\nE = mc^2,\\qquad\n\\nabla \\cdot \\mathbf{E} = \\frac{\\rho}{\\varepsilon_0}\n\\]\n```\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- C: 用 $$...$$（很多环境更认这个） -->\n    <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10); border-radius:14px; padding:14px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px; opacity:.85; margin-bottom:10px;\">方案 C：同样塞在 div 里，但用 <b>$$...$$</b>（有些环境只认这种数学块）</div>\n\n      <div style=\"padding:10px 12px; border-radius:12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.04); border:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.14);\">\n        $$\\sum_{k=1}^{n} k = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$$\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- D: 再来个矩阵 -->\n    <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10); border-radius:14px; padding:14px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px; opacity:.85; margin-bottom:10px;\">方案 D：矩阵/分式（更容易看出到底有没有渲染）</div>\n\n```latex\n\\[\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}\n1 & 2 & 3\\\\\n0 & 1 & 4\\\\\n0 & 0 & 1\n\\end{bmatrix},\n\\quad\n\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(\\sin x\\right)=\\cos x\n\\]\n```\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-top:12px; padding:10px 12px; border-radius:12px; background: rgba(0,245,212,.10); border: 1px dashed rgba(0,245,212,.35); font-size:12px; color:#c7f9f0;\">\n    你看结果：如果 div 里出现“真正的公式”而不是代码文本，就说明你的渲染器会在 HTML 容器内继续解析 LaTeX/数学块；不行的话告诉我你平台（比如哪种 Markdown 引擎），我给你换成它支持的写法～\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<img src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9334/pw=7398723091/doro/疑惑\" width=\"140\" style=\"border-radius: 8px;\">",
